    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ef9a2d21f56c686",
      "translationZh": "基准测试 本技术栈 Qwen 公布结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c74fd755b26cc9c6",
      "translationZh": "GPQA Diamond（xhigh 思考）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47d74e09fcfab20f",
      "translationZh": "GPQA 在 xhigh 下进行了测试，并提高了思考上限，但得分仍在相近水平徘徊（85.4% 对比 84.8%），因此 16k 上限几乎不损失得分，还能让最坏情况下的单轮耗时缩短约 15-28 秒。不过，如果你愿意，也可以提高上限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e61cf39d07483e9",
      "translationZh": "4 路对话切换（4 个多轮智能体对话，除基础大小外完全相同）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19f565c913c23079",
      "translationZh": "指标 60k 对话 100k 对话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce395bb471b32090",
      "translationZh": "池中能容纳两个 60k 对话并让它们并行运行；到了 100k 时只能容纳一个，因此它们轮流运行，每个对话从 RAM 恢复约需 1 秒。每个对话看起来都像是拥有专属的 100k 上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "572cb9a22a791b16",
      "translationZh": "推测 token：--speculative-dflash-block-size 6；调低 = 草稿生成占用的 VRAM 更少，但速度会慢 9-27%，每个 token 约占 250mb，因此可根据需要调高或调低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cde75740d056ce19",
      "translationZh": "最大上下文：--max-total-tokens 175064（约有 260 MiB 空闲）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3bc46786e51b63b",
      "translationZh": "视觉：去掉 --language-only，设置 150k 上下文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c139ca8a9ec867d",
      "translationZh": "供参考，我在 Ubuntu 上运行，未启用视觉功能，显示驱动（XFCE）约占用 325MB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0351b6773a936d01",
      "translationZh": "性能提升来自哪里",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d141fde9e076ba5d",
      "translationZh": "量化 lm_head（-1.7 GB，为更大的池腾出了空间）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e692cdc63d44a03a",
      "translationZh": "将 DFLASH2 草稿模型重新量化为 modelopt-NVFP4（上游版本无法在 sglang 中加载）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "903fd634ef360e75",
      "translationZh": "Block 6，将 NCCL 缓冲区强制限制为 2 MiB，使用 fp8 KV（腾出更多空间来容纳更多 KV）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b505dc154b0b5986",
      "translationZh": "由 GPU 管理的主机 RAM KV 层（ --hicache-io-backend kernel ）：由 GPU 执行 RAM 复制，因此，一段已溢出到该层的约 100k 的对话可在约 1 s 内恢复，而不是冷恢复时的约 20 s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dec0220696a56976",
      "translationZh": "froggeric 聊天模板 + 对严格思考设置上限（没有失控的推理，没有空内容，用更少的总 token 数获得 xhigh 思考的大部分收益）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9d59d7cda1891674",
      "translationZh": "额外实用技巧：在 sglang 前面加一道请求准入门控",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a834e7298a1b8ca0",
      "translationZh": "我反复遇到的问题是，一个大请求排在几个小请求前面，会浪费并行处理能力。大请求占着一个槽位时，小请求只能等待，即使预算还足够再容纳一个请求。我做了一个小型准入代理，对每个提示词进行分词，并从队列中放行能装进剩余预算的小请求，让它并行执行，而不是排在大请求后面等待。任何根本不可能完成的请求，都会在一开始就收到明确的 400 响应。sglang 只按请求数量（ --max-running-requests ）进行门控，而不是按 KV 预算；这道门控填补了这一缺口。为避免大请求被无限推迟，延迟限制设为最多 3 次、20s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63e9b38bc3aff3ac",
      "translationZh": "即使你最后没有用它，在我看来，无论服务提供方用的是 sglang、llama.cpp 还是 vLLM，增加一个准入层都值得……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a48a6f12651f805",
      "translationZh": "把这个粘贴到你的智能体里，它就会给你构建一个：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
